{"license":"CC0-1.0","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Centerdata millennium survey 1999"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"P1802"}},{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:8109"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Vinken, dr H."}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Centerdata - Universiteit Tilburg"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"h  vinken"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"pyrrhula bv"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>In samenwerking met Geassocieerde Persdiensten (GPD) is via Telepanel van CentERdata een onderzoek gedaan naar de betekenis van de eeuwwisseling voor Nederlanders (n=1391), wat zij vonden van de 20e eeuw, en of gebeurtenissen in die eeuw op de eigen geschiedenis invloed hebben. De GPD heeft in de kersbijlagen van haar dagbladen uitgebreid over het onderzoek gepubliceerd. De dataset bestaat uit 1 codeboek (millenni.pdf) en 2 databestanden (SPSS en EXCEL) met gegevens over de gesloten vragen (millep.por) en antwoorden op open vragen (millepvrb.xls; zie millenni.pdf voor meer info); ook is een document (repres.pdf) toegevoegd om de representativiteit van de data te beoordelen (gebruik weight in dataset).<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"millenniumwisseling"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"nationale geschiedenis"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"persoonlijke geschiedenis"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"levenslopen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"generaties"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"events 20e eeuw"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"historische personen 20e eeuw"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"toekomstoriëntaties"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"1999-05-01"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Henk Vinken"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Peter Ester"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Isabella Diepstraten"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2009-05-0